6. She is the sole decision-maker for her content and manages her own streams. (Verbatim: "I'm the streamer I am the streamer... I get to choose because yeah")
7. She has a strong emotional reaction to being pressured into specific stream formats or expectations. (Verbatim: "it makes me feel really icky that people would think that kind of thing")
