1. She had a strong childhood fascination with Beyblades and deeply desired one as a child. (Verbatim: "I remember like the fomo of like all the other kids at school having beyblades and they would use like the tables at school to like all play and it looked really fun")
2. She received a red, fire-themed Beyblade as a gift from her mother after persistent begging. (Verbatim: "I remember i was so happy like i actually i think i can remember if i saw it i'd remember the beyblade i got it was red it was like a fire themed beyblade and i was so happy")
