5. She and her brothers experienced extreme frustration with the game's RNG, leading them to beg for someone to win just to end the game. (Verbatim: "we were literally just trying to cheer each other it started off as a competition like no i'm going to win no i'm going to win no i'm going to win and then like it got to the end where we were just like can someone please win and free us from this game")
