8. She was exposed to disturbing content as a child, including a particularly graphic episode of Happy Tree Friends involving a moose and a spoon. (Verbatim: "i remember what happened because it was like an animal also an animal got stuck wait if i remember it right i can't remember what animal it was i want to say it was like a moose or something and it got it's like arm stuck and it didn't know how to free it so it was basically like reenacting")
9. She feels she was unusually protected as a child despite having unrestricted access to the internet. (Verbatim: "honestly i think in terms of stuff i saw though i was very very well protected as a child um yeah i didn't i feel like there was a lot lot lot lot lot more cursed horrific stuff out there")
